=== Other candidates ===
* [[Carlos Boloña]], economist and former [[Ministry of Economy and Finance (Peru)|Minister of Economy and Finance]] (1991-1993) – [[People's Solution]]
* [[Ciro Gálvez]], lawyer and notary head – [[Andean Renaissance]]
* Marco Antonio Arrunátegui, economist – [[Project Country]]
* Ricardo Noriega, lawyer and economist – [[All for Victory]]

=== Voluntarily withdrawn ===
* [[Luis Castañeda Lossio|Luis Castañeda]], lawyer and former presidential nominee – [[National Solidarity (Peru)|National Solidarity]]
* [[Jorge Santistevan]], lawyer and first national ombudsman – [[We Are Peru|Independent Movement We Are Peru - Democratic Cause]]
* [[Hernando de Soto (economist)|Hernando de Soto]], economist – Popular Capital
* Víctor M. Marroquín, international lawyer – [[Youth Independent Movement]]
* [[Martina Portocarrero]], folklore singer – [[Agricultural People's Front of Peru]]

